BEGIN:VCALENDAR
VERSION:2.0
PRODID:-//Honest Little Apps//Calendars 1.0//EN
CALSCALE:GREGORIAN
METHOD:PUBLISH
X-WR-CALNAME:Make ten — daily
X-WR-CALDESC:A free daily calendar of three quick 'make ten' number-bond qu
 estions for kids (ages 5-8): bonds to 10\, bridging through ten\, and subt
 racting to 10. Answers included. https://honestlittleapps.github.io/calend
 ars/make-ten-math-calendar-for-kids/
REFRESH-INTERVAL;VALUE=DURATION:P1D
X-PUBLISHED-TTL:P1D
COLOR:#6a2bc4
X-APPLE-CALENDAR-COLOR:#6a2bc4
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:215cd6e8b8554825d40a@honestlittleapps.github.io
DTSTAMP:20261112T030000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261101
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261102
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
RRULE:FREQ=MONTHLY;BYMONTHDAY=1
SUMMARY:Make ten: today's three
DESCRIPTION:Three quick ones:\n1) 4 + ? = 10\n2) 7 + 6 = 10 + ?\n3) 18 − 
 ? = 10\n\nTip for 2: give 3 from the 6 to the 7 to make 10\, and see what'
 s left.\n\n\n\nAnswers: 1) 6  2) 3 (so 7 + 6 = 13)  3) 8\n\n—\nFrom Numb
 er Beasts: Bond Lab\, free on the App Store: https://apps.apple.com/us/app
 /number-beasts-bond-lab/id6817125699?pt=129123876&ct=cal-make-ten-math-cal
 endar-for-kid&mt=8\nAbout this calendar: https://honestlittleapps.github.i
 o/calendars/make-ten-math-calendar-for-kids/
URL:https://apps.apple.com/us/app/number-beasts-bond-lab/id6817125699?pt=12
